  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Modernization of Plant Quarantine Service in Sri lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) improvement of facilities such as airports and port quarantine stations, etc. 2) modernization of quarantine equipment, 3) capacity building of quarantine officer, 4) expansion of GAP application, 5) standardization of international standard which complies with quarantine services, 6) building quarantine stations, providing analysis equipment, dispatch of experts and invitation training, workshops and seminars, etc. for establishment of integrated information management system on agricultural quarantine</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">to enhance ecosystem conservation and sustainable growth of economy by capacity building on plant quarantine&#xc2dd;&#xbb3c;&#xac80;&#xc5ed; &#xc81c;&#xb3c4; &#xd45c;&#xc900;&#xd654;, &#xc2dd;&#xbb3c;&#xac80;&#xc5ed; &#xae30;&#xc220; &#xac1c;&#xc120; &#xbc0f; &#xac80;&#xc0ac; &#xc815;&#xbc00;&#xd654;, &#xc218;&#xcd9c; &#xacbd;&#xc7c1;&#xb825; &#xc788;&#xb294; &#xb18d;&#xc0b0;&#xbb3c; &#xc0dd;&#xc0b0;, &#xc2a4;&#xb9ac;&#xb791;&#xce74; &#xc2dd;&#xbb3c;&#xac80;&#xc5ed; &#xc5c5;&#xbb34; &#xbc0f; &#xc11c;&#xbe44;&#xc2a4; &#xd6a8;&#xc728;&#xd654;</narrative>
  </description>
